Package: talkscore
Title: Semantic Analysis and Scoring of Scientific Presentations
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Marina", "Galesic", , "marina.galesic@ki.se", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: TalkScore is an R package that uses semantic analysis of
    presentation notes to classify content into categories such as
    background, evidence, conclusions, and clinical relevance,
    generating scores to evaluate scientific communication quality.
    Future versions will use automated language analysis to distinguish
    talks for scientific or public audiences without manually curated
    keyword lists.
